   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 · first / last frame\n\nThe **Director** draws the move, **Guide Frames** carries your first frame along it, and **H3 Shot** hands H3 the first frame, the frame where the camera ends, the length (17k+5), the size and a prompt with the camera move in words. H3 then performs *your* move.\n\n- Model files: the names of the official MiniMax H3 templates - swap for yours.\n- Faster: enable the Turbo LoRA (Ctrl+B) and set steps 6-8.\n- Longer than 20 s: raise `segment` on H3 Shot and feed each render's last frame forward."
   ]
  }
